OL,3,GNEWSAWayne Rooney: From 'Crocky' to I'm
OL,4,AA Celebrity
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a football-mad schoolboy, he used to
OL,7,Fscale the fence of the shut Gems youth
OL,8,Fcentre to make sure he could still get
OL,9,Fa kickabout on its pitch.
OL,11,FThe eight-year-old Wayne Rooney would
OL,12,Fplay in car parks, patches of grass and
OL,13,Feven by garages behind his future
OL,14,Fwife's house in Croxteth, Liverpool.
OL,16,FThe former England captain has credited
OL,17,Fhis upbringing in deprived Croxteth, or
OL,18,F"Crocky" as the locals call it, with
OL,19,Fhelping him scale the heights of the
OL,20,Ffootball world.
